1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT '''Johann Leonhard Keplinger'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:	1688 - Schwaigern, Heilbronn, Baden-Württemberg, Germany
2 CONT Death:	1753 - Windsor Township, Berks, Pennsylvania, United States
2 CONT Parents:	John Lewis Keplinger, Catherine Keplinger (born Fitzwater)
2 CONT Wife:	Maria Elisabetha Keplinger (born Blind)
2 CONT Children:	Johannes Kepplinger, Rev Johann Georg Kepplinger, Johann Paul Kepplinger, Johann Leonard Kepplinger, Maria Elisabetha Kepplinger, Christian Kepplinger
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Caplinger, Jacob 1773 - 1824 Jacob Caplinger Bible Records 
2 CONT
2 CONT This is said to be exactly as it appears on the page in the Bible. It appears to be nothing but information on Jacob Caplinger, wife & children. One of the pages of the Bible includes the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT Record of the ages of Jacob Caplinger  Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Caplinger was born April 22, 1773<nowiki>-----</nowiki>died Feb. 19th 1842.
2 CONT
2 CONT wife, Barbary Caplinger was born May 15th, 1780 --died Aug 6, 1824. md 1798 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Solomon Caplinger was born the 14th July 1799
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Susanah Caplinger was born the 4th day March 1801
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * John Caplinger was born December 27th 1802
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * William Caplinger was born June 20th 1805
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Elizabeth Caplinger was born November 17, 1808
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Samuel Caplinger was born March 1, 1810
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Jane Caplinger was born March 8, 1812
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Polly Caplinger was born November 7, 1814
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Nancy Caplinger was born May 22, 1817
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Eliza Pitterson Caplinger was born Jan 24th 1820  died Aug 12 1823.
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Martha Caplinger was born June 23rd 1823  died March 11, 1824
2 CONT
2 CONT The very first page of the records section of Jacob's Bible includes the following:
2 CONT *Solomon Caplinger was married the 20th day of September 1821 to Martha Mapey [was erased  changed, so not sure that spelling is correct] .....Different spellings of the name: Kepplinger, Kiplinger, Caplinger,Caplenner, Kiblinger,
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT Kepplinger Family came over on a boat called Thistle of Glasgow Aug. 29 1730.
2 CONT
2 CONT They settled in Berk County Pennsylvania.....
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Leonard or Leonardt Kepplinger Born in Germany about 1688 wife Maria Elizabeth born about 1692  all of the children were born in Schwaigern, Kraichgau, Germany.....
2 CONT
2 CONT unknown from a WorldConnect file, Find A Grave Memorial# 28995878 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Caplinger Birth: Apr. 22, 1773  Death: Feb. 19, 1824  Burial: Caplinger Cemetery, Marion, Williamson, Illinois Created by: Jan Miller Record added: Aug 13, 2008 
2 CONT
2 CONT Arrival: Ship Name: Thistle Of Glascow 
2 CONT
2 CONT Departed: Palentine, Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT 1730 Port Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, United States
