2 CONT
2 CONT One record on Ancestry.com has Catharine and Johann begin married in 1745, however their youngest son was born in 1743, so I don't think this date is correct. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes on FindAGrave.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	1712, Germany Death: 	1789 West Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael was married to Catherine Propst. His daughter, Maria Eva Propst, married Henry Huffman Sr.
2 CONT
2 CONT John (Johann) Michael Propst, born 1713, came from Germany by way of Rotterdam and England on Captain Hugh Percy's ship, "Samuel".
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael is listed as a "pioneer" in the Grave Register for Pendleton Co., West Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT From another source (willow703@aol.com): Johann Michael Propst, born 13 Sep 1707, Bonnigheim, Wurttemburg, Germany, died perhaps Jul 1789, but before 3 Aug 1789, when his will, dated 19 Dec 1785, Rockingham Co., VA, was proved in 
2 CONC Pendleton Co., Virginia (now West Virginia) court. he is son of Hans Michael and Barbara Katarina Propst.
2 CONT --------------------
