1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacob Hammer BIRTH	21 Feb 1821 Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA DEATH	24 Feb 1898 (aged 77) Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Jacob Hammer Cemetery Pendleton County, West Virginia
2 CONT
