1 NOTE {geni:about_me} His Sons of the American Revolution application only has 1746 as his date of birth, no month or day. Likewise, Colonial And Revolutionary Families Of Pennsylvania : Hamilton page 529 by John W. Jordan, also has the
2 CONC  year of birth as 1746, no month or day. 
2 CONT
2 CONT As for the death date, the Sons of the American Revolution application has November 24, 1810 and so does the book mentioned above.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Graduated at the Academy of Pa., and afterwards at the University of Edinburgh. He was a surgeon in the Revolutionary Army. He first located at Reading, and married a MISS JONES of that place, and afterwards returned to Lancaster,
2 CONC  where he practiced till his death. He was one of the leading physicians of Lancaster. Dr. John Kuhn was the son of Adam Simon Kuhn and Anna Maria Sabina Schrack. He was married to Susanna Jones and served as a doctor in the Revol
2 CONC utionary War.
