1 NAME Maria Sabina /Kuhn/
2 GIVN Maria Sabina
2 SURN Kuhn
2 _MARNM Ross
2 NICK Polly
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 18 SEP 1752
1 DEAT
2 DATE 30 DEC 1826
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anna Maria Sabina KUHN was born on 18 SEP 1752 in Lancaster Co., PA. She was baptized on 5 OCT 1752 in Trinity Lutheran Church, Lancaster, Lancaster Co., PA. She died on 30 DEC 1826 in Columbia, Lancaster Co., PA.2
2 CONC 0 She was called "Polly" by family and friends. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married  
2 CONT # Col. James Ross 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT # Catherine Thompson Ross+
2 CONT # William Ross
2 CONT # Col. George Thompson Ross+
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Sabina Kuhn's mother was Maria Sabina Schrack, daughter of Johann Jacob and Eva Rosina Schrack. She was b. at sea Oct 26, 1717, and bap. Swedish Church, Philadelphia, Jan 12, 1718; she died 1799. See record the Trappe church
2 CONC . She married Adam Simon Kuhn Dec. 11, 1740; record aforesaid says: Johan Adam Simon Kuhn and Anna Maria Sarina Schrackin, daughter of Hans Jacob and Euphrosina Schrackin. Adam Simon Kuhn was born Dec. 26, 1713, d. Jan 23, 1780.
2 CONT
2 CONT James Ross born Lancaster, Pa., November 28, 1753, died, Natchez, Miss., August 24, 1808 in 55th year (E. H. Bell says, died August 20, 1809), married Maria Sabina Kuhn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://www.djhooker.com/26/10990.htm
