2 CONT About Heinrich Propst
2 CONT A Patriot of the American Revolution for NORTH CAROLINA. DAR Ancestor # A091797
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.webring.org/l/rd?ring=millerfamilies;id=12;url=http%3A%2... Dr. Heinrich Propst, MD(?)
