2 CONT 7. JOHN WILLIAM PATTERSON6 SR. (LOUIS ALLEN PATTERSON5, MARY LUCRETIA4 PROPST, CAPT. WILLIAM3, HENRY PROPST2 JR., HENRY (HEINRICH) PROPST1 SR.) was born 03 Sep 1914 in Concord, NC, and died 22 Jul 1995 in Salisbury, NC. He married
2 CONC  RUTH RUFTY 10 Jan 1943 in Salisbury, NC, daughter of OLIVER RUFTY and NANNY LEMLY. She was born 29 Aug 1923 in Salisbury, NC, and died 04 May 2005 in Salisbury, NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JOHN WILLIAM PATTERSON SR.:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Patterson was unable to serve in the military due to medical problems. He did work in Wright's Automatic Machine Shop, Durham, NC. They built bombsights for military aircraft.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family history at:
2 CONT
2 CONT www.gorowan.com/rowanroots/
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOHN SR. and RUTH RUFTY are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Mary Harriet7 Patterson, b. Private; m. Robert Calvin Kluttz, Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. John William Patterson Jr., b. Private; m. Cindy Ruth Workman, Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Daniel Michael Patterson, b. Private; m. Jatana Lynne Smith, Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Thomas Rufty Patterson Sr., b. Private; m. Carolyn Jane Seay, Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. FRANK EARL PATTERSON6 SR. (LOUIS ALLEN PATTERSON5, MARY LUCRETIA4 PROPST, CAPT. WILLIAM3, HENRY PROPST2 JR., HENRY (HEINRICH) PROPST1 SR.) was born 28 Dec 1918 in Concord, NC, and died 28 Nov 2002 in Concord, NC. He married RUT
2 CONC H MANN Private. She was born Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for FRANK EARL PATTERSON SR.:
2 CONT
2 CONT Frank Patterson entered the Army in January 1941. Company E, 30th. Division, 119 Infantry. His unit left Boston and landed in South Hampton, England. They visited France, Belgium, Netherlands & Germany. Were in 5 major battles inc
2 CONC luding the Battle of the Bulge. He left service in September 1945.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANK SR. and RUTH MANN are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Carol Ann7 Patterson, b. Private; m. Jeffrey Alan Gilbert, Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Cynthia Ruth Patterson, b. Private; m. Jack Briggman, Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Frank Earl Patterson Jr., b. Private; m. Susan Brines, Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. DOROTHY CORNELIA6 PATTERSON (LOUIS ALLEN PATTERSON5 SR., MARY LUCRETIA4 PROPST, CAPT. WILLIAM3, HENRY PROPST2 JR., HENRY (HEINRICH) PROPST1 SR.) was born Private. She married GEORGE BAGBY BRANDON JR. Private, son of GEORGE SR a
2 CONC nd LILLIAN SUTHER. He was born 29 Jun 1922 in Kannapolis, NC, and died 30 Jun 2001 in Salisbury, NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for GEORGE BAGBY BRANDON JR.:
2 CONT
2 CONT George Brandon entered the Army Air Corp. in March 1943. 93rd. Heavy bomb group. Squad 335 flying B-24's for General Doolittle. Flew 11 missions and shot down on June 11, 1944. He was a navigator. His unit flew to England via Labr
2 CONC ador, Iceland and then England. They flew missions all over Europe. He was shot down and spent time in POW camp "Stalag Luft #3 in Sagan, Poland". When Russians got to close they were moved to Moosburg, S. Germany. "Stalag 7A". He
2 CONC  left service in September 1945. Returned back to USA at Boston.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of DOROTHY PATTERSON and GEORGE JR. are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. George Bagby7 Brandon III, b. 23 May 1946, Concord, NC; d. 04 Nov 1949.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Richard Allen Brandon, b. Private; m. Linda Goodnight, Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Thomas Hall Brandon, b. Private; m. George Ann Culp, Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. MARY LILLIAN6 PATTERSON (LOUIS ALLEN PATTERSON5 SR., MARY LUCRETIA4 PROPST, CAPT. WILLIAM3, HENRY PROPST2 JR., HENRY (HEINRICH) PROPST1 SR.) was born Private. She married JAMES RUSSELL SHROPSHIRE SR. Private. He was born Priva
2 CONC te.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARY PATTERSON and JAMES SR. are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Jo Ann7 Shropshire, b. Private; m. (1) Danny Bost, Private; b. Private; m. (2) James Fletcher Lomax, Private; b. 10 Apr 1942, Concord, NC; d. 19 Mar 1999, Concord, NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. James Russell Shropshire Jr., b. Private; m. Judith Tarlton, Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Edward Michael Shropshire, b. 28 Apr 1950, Concord, NC; d. 17 Jul 1973, Folkston, Ga..
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. MILDRED ANN6 PATTERSON (LOUIS ALLEN PATTERSON5 SR., MARY LUCRETIA4 PROPST, CAPT. WILLIAM3, HENRY PROPST2 JR., HENRY (HEINRICH) PROPST1 SR.) was born Private. She married BOYD ARCHIE BIGGERS Private, son of JOHN BIGGERS and ANN
2 CONC IE BOST. He was born Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MILDRED PATTERSON and BOYD BIGGERS are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Lou Ann7 Biggers, b. Private; m. Floyd Lee Carter Jr., Private; b. Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Janet Lynn Biggers, b. Private; m. (1) Ray Marshall Cook, Private; b. Private; m. (2) Ronald Gold Overcash, Private; b. Private.
