2 CONC kfelder Library, Pennsburg, PA, 1953. [NOTE: DavidSchultze mentions surveying a 40 acre tract in 1774 for George Steinrock andChristian is listed with a forty acre tract in tax lists from 1783 through1789. Tax lists for the period
2 CONC  before 1782 are not available][NOTE: The ManatawnyCreek runs in a north-south axis through the westside of Pottstown and verynear the Steinruck homestead]
