1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Frederick George Propst
2 CONT BIRTH
2 CONT 4 Jun 1738
2 CONT Rockingham County, Virginia, USA
2 CONT DEATH
2 CONT 1801 (aged 62–63)
2 CONT Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA
