1 NOTE {geni:about_me} It appears that 7 year old Elizabeth was one of the children taken captive by the Shawnee Chieftain Killbuck. Elizabeth next appears 7 years later when on 5-21-1765 an Augusta County VA Court approved her choice of
2 CONC  John Dunkle as her guardian. This John Dunkle was a neighbor of Nicholas Hevener and of Frederick, his son and Elizabeth's future husband, in the South Branch community.
