2 CONT Sampson C Dahmer was a Soldier of the Confederate Army of the Civil War from 1861 to 1865 he enlisted as a private on May 18 1861 and was assigned to Company B 31st infantry and was reassigned to Company B 25th infantry of Virgini
2 CONC a in May 1 1862. He fought in numerous battles with both units and became a Sgt. He was captured and confined to Elmira N.Y. Prison as a POW, After the war he moved from Virginia and settled in Vernon County Nevada Mo. Sampson C D
2 CONC ahmer died in October 1895 after being thrown from a horse on his farm. Sampson C Dahmer leaves 9 children and a wife..
