1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In 1776 moved from Hampshire Co West Virginia to what was then Ohio Co West Virginia.  Was Militia Captian.  In 1778 moved to Henslon Co Kentucky where they purchased a small tract and inherited several hundred acr
2 CONC es form Pollys father and brother.  In 1808  they sold and moved to Knox Co Indiana where they enrolled as charter members of the Maria Creek Baptist Church in May 1809.  John served in the Revolutionary War
2 CONT --------------------
