2 CONT George was son of Abraham Coil and Susanna Hammer. About 1852 he married Nancy Graham daughter of Isaac and Barbara Coil Graham. Of this union there were born at least eight children,Isaac Welsey, James Harvey, Abraham Newton, Wil
2 CONC liam W., Ulysses S. Grant, Jacob Hammer, Andrew Jackson, And Susan or Mary Susan. Nancy died in 1904 and George married Mary Emily Greenawalt in 1911. Of this union there were born 5 children,Lula , George Washington Kile ,Jr., Id
2 CONC a D. Kile, Isom Kile and Leslie Kile.
