2 CONT Obituary- Mrs. Isaac H. Davis Dies
2 CONT
2 CONT The many friends of Mrs. Isaac H. Davis were shocked to hear of her death on last Saturday morning in Harrisonburg, a few days after she had undergone an operation at Rockingham Memorial Hospital.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Davis had been in failing health for some months, but the seriousness of her condition was not known until after the operation [cancer of the liver], from which she rapidly weakened until death ensued.
2 CONT
