1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Ursula A Lough Bowers Birth 	10 Sep 1855 Death 	6 May 1907 (aged 51) Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA Burial 	 Bowers Cemetery #20 Franklin, Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA Memorial ID 	156364829
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/156364829
2 CONT
2 CONT Ursula Bowers, born September 10th, 1855 and died May 6th, 1907, aged 51 years 7 months and 26 days.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Bowers was the youngest child of William and Christina Hammer Lough, his first wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT On June 5th 1875, she was married to Henry Bowers, a true and noble hearted man. One year after her marriage believing it to be her duty as a christian woman she connected herself to the German Baptist church and had lived in the 
2 CONC embrace of the christian religion until Christ her Lord saw in her earthly life enough of her trials and afflictions and in his own good time he called her to come up and rest with the redeemed, where she will praise her God and t
2 CONC he Lamb in songs of nobler praise.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a true and ideal woman, and never was husband and wife more devoted to each other; and to this union were born 10 children, 4 which preceded the mother to the grave, and to the family who so deeply mourn the loss of a wife
2 CONC  and mother it is needless to say that we sympathize with them.
2 CONT
2 CONT We no longer hear her kind voice, we look into her seat and see it vacant. Mother has gone to try the untried realities of Eternity. She can not come back to us but we can go to her, and how dear mother will be to us again.
2 CONT
2 CONT To the berieved we would say not to look upon mother as resting beneath the cold cods of earth, for she has followed only in the footsteps of our blessed Saviour for now is Christ risen and become the first fruits of them that sle
2 CONC pt.
2 CONT
2 CONT {Abstracted from Pendleton County Obituaries}
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Ursula A Lough Bowers
2 CONT BIRTH
2 CONT 10 Sep 1855
2 CONT DEATH
2 CONT 6 May 1907 (aged 51)
2 CONT BURIAL
2 CONT Bowers Cemetery #26
2 CONT Franklin, Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/193786227/ursula-a-bowers
