1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Michael Zirkle BIRTH	29 Jun 1735 Telford, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania, USA DEATH	2 Oct 1811 (aged 76) Forestville, Shenandoah County, Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Zirkle Cemetery New Market, Shenandoah County, Virgini
2 CONC a
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/33373650/michael-zirkle
2 CONT
2 CONT DAR Ancestor #: A131099 
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael Zirkle (son of Johann Ludwig "Lewis" Zirckel and Eva Maria Bear) was born Jan 29, 1735 in Telford, Franconia Twp, Philadelphia Co, PA, and died Oct 02, 1811 in Forestville, Shenandoah, VA. He married Catharine Sehler on 17
2 CONC 62, daughter of Johannes Schlern.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Includes NotesNotes for Michael Zirkle:
2 CONT
2 CONT Removed from PA to the Shenandoah Valley in VA about 1765, settling on or near Holmes/Hollmans Creek; served as a private in the VA militia in the Revolutionary war; elder in the Old Pine Lutheran Church, Mill Creek, Shenandoah Co
2 CONC , Va 1787.
2 CONT
2 CONT Might be buried in Rockingham County.
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTES FOR MICHAEL ZIRKLE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael Zirkle and his wife Catherine Schlearn had 14 children. Their 14 children were baptized at St. Mary's Lutheran Church in New Market Va. When the younger generation became crowded for land, many went west and were among the
2 CONC  first settlers of Ohio. The signpost of the church they founded at Thackery, Ohio to this day, bears the name of Zerkel Lutheran Church. One of the children that remained in the New Market area was Michael's son Jonathon Zirkle w
2 CONC ho was born June 11, 1789 and married Elizabeth Woloamood. (Dave Zirkle)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MICHAEL ZIRKLE and CATHERINE SCHLEARN are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. JONATHON ZIRKLE, b. June 11, 1789, Homes Creek Shenandoah Va.; d. Jan.01,1855, Shenandoah Co
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. CATHERINE ZIRKLE b. August 14, 1763
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. MAGDALENA ZIRKLE, b. September 19, 1764
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. JOHN ZIRKLE, b. February 27,1766
2 CONT
2 CONT v. ELIZABETH ZIRKLE, b. September 17,1767
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. ANNA MARY ZIRKLE, b. June 20, 1770,
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. MICHAEL ZIRKLE JR., b. April 15, 1772
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. GEORGE ZIRKLE, b. August 21, 1774
2 CONT
2 CONT ix. LEWIS ZIRKLE, b. July 01,1776
2 CONT
2 CONT x. HENRY ZIRKLE, b. April 14, 1778
2 CONT
2 CONT xi. ABRAHAM ZIRKLE, b. August 08, 1780
2 CONT
2 CONT xii. JACOB ZIRKLE, b. March 1782
2 CONT
2 CONT xiii. RACHEL ZIRKLE, b. September 02, 1786
2 CONT
2 CONT xiv. SUSANNA ZIRKLE, b. July 26, 1792
2 CONT
2 CONT Children baptized at St. Mary's Lutheran Church in New Market
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Michael Zirkle:
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Nease/Zirkle Cemetery, Forestville.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Michael Zirkle and Catharine Sehler:
2 CONT
