2 CONC d: Lud Zirkle, May, 1770 Volume III, page 552 – Deed Book 22, page 107 16 November, 1776 Michael Sircle and Catherine (), of Dunmore County, to Ludwick Fulmor (delivered: John Separs, 20th August 1793), 130 acres patented to John 
2 CONC Bair 10th March, 1755, and conveyed by him to Eve Sircle; also 54 acres patented to my mother, Eve Sircle, now deceased, 10th September, 1755, and descended to Michael as eldest son and heir of Eve.
