2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT <p>He served in the militia (Shenandoah Co.,) in 1755.He was a farmer. He was a census taker in 1785. He was Lutheran.</p>
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT <p>He farmed near Forestville, Virginia and at his death owned</p><p>several farms, a tan yard, and other investments.  Public</p><p>records show he bought or sold several tracts of land,</p><p>beginning with the purchase of land 
2 CONC on Holman's Creek, near</p><p>Forestville, in 1755 and a land grant from Lord Fairfax that</p><p>same year.  He wrote in German.  He served in the Shenandoah</p><p>CountyMilitia in 1775 and was a census taker in 1785.  They</p><p>
2 CONC worshiped at Rader's Lutheran Church, near Timberville, until</p>Pine Church (now St. Mary's), near Rinkerton, was built.
2 CONT
