1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/40964972/catharine-roush
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharine Zirkle (daughter of Michael Zirkle and Catharine Sehler) was born Aug 14, 1763 in Forestville, Shenandoah Co, VA, and died Abt. 1810 in Shenandoah Co, VA. She married George Roush, son of Johannes Adam Rausch and Susanna
2 CONC h Sehler.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Includes NotesNotes for Catharine Zirkle: Oral history says that Catharine became ill and himesickl, and George took her back to Shenandoah, where she died soon after.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Catharine Zirkle and George Roush are:
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. +John Roush, b. Nov 22, 1785, Shenandoah, VA, d. Jan 21, 1861, Meigs, OH.
2 CONT    2. +Mary Roush, b. Feb 24, 1801, Meigs Co, Ohio, d. Mar 23, 1887, Mason Co, WV.
2 CONT --------------------
