1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Family tree sources show she was the daughter of Charles Ovenshire, mother not known, born September 18, 1834 in
2 CONT Romulus, Seneca Co., NY and died April 26, 1919 in Faifield, Lenawee Co., MI. She married Norman McInyre on February 7, 1851 and they were the parents of Amelia Ann McIntyre, Anna Elenor McIntyre and Eugene McIntyre.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death certificate shows she was the daughter of Charles Ovenshire (NY) and Margaret Speed (England), female, white, widowed, wife of Norman McIntyre, born September 18, 1834 New York State and died on April 26, 1919 in Fairfield, 
2 CONC Fairfield Twp., Lenawee Co., MI at the age of 84 years 7 months and 8 days, cause of death meningitis.
2 CONT Burial was on April 28 in Fairfield Cemetery, Lenawee Co.
2 CONT
