2 CONT
2 CONT Headstone: Wilson m Rebecca Shelton White in 1939. She had 5 children with her 1st husband, Archibald Cathey White. They are listed on the headstone along with Rebecca & Wilson's 5 children. Daniel Edney Propst 1839-1864 killed in
2 CONC  Civil War Hamby Propst 1842-1896 d in Columbus, MS Minerva Propst born & died 1845 Probably in NC before family came to AL Julia Shelton Bell Propst 1846-1935 d in Fayette, AL Wincie Brent Propst 1949-1912 Jacob Propst 1852-1908 
2 CONC d in Birmingham, AL Also on this same marker: Martin Propst 1856- son of Wilson by his 2nd marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
