1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Died - In Fullerton, Neb., May 9th, 1881, Mrs. Sarah Ann Harman (sic), aged 55 years, 18 days.
2 CONT
2 CONT With pain we chronicle the death of this highly esteemed and respected lady.
2 CONT After a protracted illness she has been released from suffering and passed from an earth of sadness and woe to her merited reward. During the entire period of her affliction she exhibited a forbearing and Christian spirit and depa
2 CONC rted this sphere in full faith of again taking up the thread of life and bearing it on forever through flowery realms of the Great Unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT From an 1881 Nance County clipping file, date not indicated, transcribed by Linda Berney
