2 CONT
2 CONT "He farmed in Bradley County, TN until 1851 when he moved to Sangamon County, east of Loami, IL." (Info. from David & Leonard Dodd)
2 CONT
2 CONT "From a record kept by Jesse Dodd(son of Charles Scott Dodd):
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles was born the 19th of June 1811, and married Mary Templeton Jones.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born in Springfield, Ill., OR a native of North Carolina and had
2 CONT
2 CONT been raised from infancy by her stepmother and her father, A. Joshua
2 CONT
2 CONT Bingham Jones.
2 CONT
2 CONT They lived in McMinn County, Tenn, at the time of their wedding. They were
2 CONT
2 CONT the parents of ten children born in Tennessee: Catherine, Nancy, Josiah,
2 CONT
2 CONT Joshua, James, William, Mary Ann, Amelia, Sarah and Charles."
2 CONT
2 CONT (Info. from David & Leonard Dodd)" 
2 CONT
2 CONT • Land, sold farm east of Loami and bought 20 acre farm for $11/acre in the southeast part of, 1852-19 Nov 1881 - Loami Township, Sangamon County, Illinois 
