1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of John and Margaret (Peggy) Deady Obenchain. He married Hannah Keeley, 1859, in Iowa and Julia Breshar (sp?) in Oregon, 1882. Together they had two children: Dewey b. 1898 and Pearl b. 1901.
2 CONT George moved west with parents and siblings from Iowa and in 1877, at Sprague River, Klamath, Oregon, he purchased his 158 acre ranch that he eventually spread into 800 acres; he farmed but was known for quality stock raising, own
2 CONC ing 200 cows and 80 horses
