1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Henry Huffman Sr. BIRTH	1757 Rockingham County, Virginia, USA DEATH	Jun 1835 (aged 77–78) Mitchell, Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Rader-Mitchell Cemetery Mitchell, Pendleton County, West Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/21820317/henry-huffman
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Photo	 Michael Huffman 1783–1872
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan Elizabeth Huffman Rexroad 1784 – unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo	 Catharine Huffman Jordan 1788–1885
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo	 Sarah Huffman Rexroad 1789–1876
