2 CONT Henry Huffman is the son of Henry and Mary Eve/Maria Eva Propst Huffman.Husband of Elizabeth Sarah Hartman Huffman couple was married in Pendleton County, West Virginia. Henry and Elizabeth had twelve children to this union; Peter
2 CONC  b. 29 January 1823, Mrs. Leah Householder b. 10 March 1825, Henry Jr., Jacob b. 27 January 1830, William James, b. 12 April 1833, Eliza, b. 9 April 1831, James Edward, b. 12 April 1833, Mary A. b. 14 May 1835, Sarah b. 22 Februar
2 CONC y 1838, Howard b. 26 May 1840, John b. 25 June 1842, and Hannah Huffman b. 5 March 1845.Descendants of Henry Huffman Chapter 6 - Henry Huffman Jr.Will of Henry Huffman: Transcribed by David Bruty I Henry Huffman of the County of H
2 CONC amilton and State of Indiana do hereby make my last Will and Testament in maner and following.   That is to Say.     1st I desire that all my property borh personal Real Shall befor the use of my Beloved wife Sarah her life time f
2 CONC or her benifit to raise my Children and at her dexease the Estate to be Sold and Equally to be divided between W" H. Huffman, Eliza Huffman, James E. Huffman, Polly Huffman, Sarah Huffman, Howard Huffman, John Huffman, Hannah Huff
2 CONC man all children of my present wife Sarah.     2nd I give to my Son William H. Huffman my Soral Colt to him and his heirs forever.      3dly I give to my Peter one dollar as his share of my Estate.     4" I give to my daughter Lea
2 CONC h Householder one dollar her share of my Estate.     5th I give to my son Henry Huffman one dollar as his share of my Estate.        And lastly I do hereby Couslitute and apoires my friend Josiah M. Malery Executer of this my last
2 CONC  Will and Testament hereby revoking all other or former Will and Testaments by me henthfor made. In Witness when of I hair hereuto Set my hand and Seal this 26 th day of Feburary in the year of our Lord 1848.    Henry Huffman* Ref
