1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Barbara Pence Propst
2 CONT BIRTH
2 CONT 1748
2 CONT Hampshire County, West Virginia, USA
2 CONT DEATH
2 CONT 11 Nov 1829 (aged 80–81)
2 CONT Propstburg, Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA
2 CONT BURIAL
2 CONT Propst Church Cemetery
2 CONT Pendleton County, West Virginia,
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/5716620/barbara-propst
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbara, a daughter of Valentine and Anna Maria Catherine (Oberlin) Pence, was born in 1748 and died in November 1829 in Pendleton County VA.  Barbara married 1st to George Frederick Propst & 2nd to Jacob Conrad (2nd wife). There 
2 CONC is no primary evidence for her 1st marriage or of her birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Disputed Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT She Is seen as daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Mark-Marcus-Swadley-Sr/6000000005218875494?through=309214865330005734 & https://www.geni.com/people/Catren-Swadley/6000000000783629292?through=309214865330005734.  
2 CONT
2 CONT A stronger argument is made for her as a Pence child.  See: 
2 CONT
2 CONT “Barbara Propst, the wife of George Frederick Propst.” by Jeff Carr
2 CONT
2 CONT >”George Frederick Propst was the son of John Michael and Catherine Elizabeth Propst; his wife was clearly named Barbara. I am writing this because several people have asked for verification of my assertion that Barbara Propst was
2 CONC  a daughter of Valentine and Maria Catherine (Oberlin) Pence. Prior to this, researchers (most of whom are Swadley descendants) have believed that she was Barbara Swadley, a daughter of Mark and Catherine Swadley. It is unclear wh
2 CONC ere began the notion that she was a Swadley; Oren Morton did not identify any maiden name for Barbara in his History of Pendleton County, WV; I will discuss this further in item #9. What follows is a combination of facts, circumst
2 CONC antial evidence, logic, and debate. ....” http://family.beacondeacon.com/Barbara-Propst-wife-of-George-Frederick-Propst.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT ====== References for Barbara 
2 CONT * [https://www.wvgenweb.org/calhoun/fpropst.htm The Family of Frederick Propst]
2 CONT * [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/5716620 Find a grave]
2 CONT * [https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=sanford-shulsen&id=I125389 Rootsweb includes the will]
2 CONT * [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/9123116/person/420181774306/facts?_phsrc=chY6344&_phstart=successSource Ancestry tree]
2 CONT * [https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/G9MR-P25 Family Search]
2 CONT * [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Swadley-37 Wikitree]
2 CONT * Netherlands, GenealogieOnline Trees Index, 1000-2015: Barbara Swadley. age 81, Birth 1748, Augusta, Hampshire, West Virginia. Death: 11 Nov 1829 in Propstburg, Pendleton, West Virginia. Spouse: Frederick George Propst 
2 CONT * http://family.beacondeacon.com/Barbara-Propst-wife-of-George-Frederick-Propst.pdf
2 CONT * https://hackerscreek.com/norman/PROBST.htm
2 CONT * Barbara Propst Conrad BIRTH	unknown DEATH	unknown Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Conrad Cemetery Ruddle, Pendleton County, West Virginia https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/5723091/barbara-conrad Grave Registration
2 CONC  of Pendleton Co., listed no birth or death dates for Barbara.
