2 CONT
2 CONT James Dyer, a son of Roger and Hannah Dyer, was born about 1744 and died in 1807. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James was captured at Ft. Seybert in Augusta Counhty VA in 1758 and held captive in OH for two years. He escaped into PA and eventually made his way back to present day Pendleton County VA.
2 CONT
