2 CONT
2 CONT BORN probably in Pendleton Co., (W) Virginia, on September 17, 1823
2 CONT
2 CONT SECOND wife of George William Keister, Sr. (1776-1854) [married @ South Fork, Pendleton Co., (W) VA, on October 12, 1843] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She applied for a widow's pension for the service of her husband, George Keister, in the War of 1813-1814
2 CONT
2 CONT DIED at Brandywine, Pendleton Co., W. Va., on April 19, 1899
