1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Adam Mallow Sr. BIRTH	6 Oct 1751 Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA DEATH	27 Nov 1841 (aged 90) Austin, Ross County, Ohio, USA BURIAL	 Mallow Cemetery Austin, Ross County, Ohio
2 CONT
