2 CONT Died at Crabbottom of general debility. Age 84 years. Parents Jno. & Marg. Rexrode. Widower. Death reported by his son-in-law S.H. Eye. Death Records of Highland. Solomon operated the flour mill in New Hampden, started by his fath
2 CONC er John Rexrode. Solomon married Eleanor Rymer on June 9, 1831. For more information on the Rexrodes & the New Hampden Mill read "The Rexrode Mill at New Hampden, Va. A History" by William D. Rexroad.
