2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan Hefner was born the son of Peter & Elizabeth Propst Hefner. He married Margaret Jane Fleisher in 1835 in Pendleton County, WV. After her death (in 1851), he married Angelina Jack in 1852. He was a farmer and a shoemaker.
