1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ferdinand Lair Dean BIRTH	13 Nov 1810 Virginia, USA DEATH	14 May 1891 (aged 80) Braxton County, West Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Morrison UM Church Cemetery Sutton, Braxton County, West Virginia
2 CONT
