1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Lucinda Hinkle Dean''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Upshur, West Virginia, United States on 01 Aug 1841 to Archibald Hinkle and Mary Phillips. Lucinda Hinkle married George Washington Dean and had 11 children. She passed away on 31 Oct 1927 in Upshur, West Virginia, United 
2 CONC States.
2 CONT
2 CONT BURIAL	 Kesling Mill Cemetery Buckhannon, Upshur County, West Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NOTE:''' There are 2 other George W. Dean's born about the same time and living in WV, one in Lewis County and one in Cabell County and they are often confused with each other. She is married to George b. 1834 - d. November 19,
2 CONC  1920. He was buried in the Kesling Mill Cemetery, Buckhannon, Upshur County, West Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lucinda Hinkle and George Washington Dean (14):
2 CONT
2 CONT # Anthony C. Dean 1862–1954	 
2 CONT # Infant Boy Dean 1863–1863	
2 CONT # Mary Virginia Dean Hinkle 1865–1948, m. John William Hinkle	 
2 CONT # Eldania or Etfania Dean 1867–unknown
2 CONT # Emma Byrd Dean Oldaker 1867–1940, m. David Oldaker	
2 CONT # Esta May Dean Jackson 1868–1954, m. Marion Columbus Jackson	
2 CONT # William M. Dean 1871–1935	
2 CONT # George Washington Dean 1872–1920	 
2 CONT # Philmore M. Dean 1872–1941	
2 CONT # Jacob Lloyd Dean 1873–1933	
2 CONT # Archibald Dean 1876–1955	 
2 CONT # Ida C. Dean Teets 1877–1953, m. Granville Teets	
2 CONT # Etta Columbia Dean Mowry 1882–1959, m. Albert Mowry	 
2 CONT # Waitman Bernard Dean 1886–1969
2 CONT
