2 CONT Clarksburg Telegram
2 CONT Clarksburg, West Virginia
2 CONT December 14, 1952
2 CONT
2 CONT 50th Anniversay Celebrated
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. and Mrs. Arch Dean, Buckhannon, celebrated thier Golden Wedding Anniversay with open house from 3 to 4 p.m. Sunday Dec.7 at thier home.
2 CONT
2 CONT They were married December 3, 1902 at Deanville by the Rev. Pigott.  Mr. Dean is the son of the late George and Lucinda Dean and Mrs. Dean is the daughter of the late Gideon Jack and Mrs. Sophia Griffith Jack of Rt.4 Buckhannon.  
2 CONC Mr. and Mrs. Dean have been life long residents of Buckhannon, where Mr. Dean is active in farming.
2 CONT
2 CONT The couple has eight living children: Mrs. Ima McIntire, Mrs. Georgia Smith, Mrs. Juanita Gainor, Mrs. Ruth Nesbitt, Ray Dean and Grant Dean all of Clarksburg; and Dexter and Virgil Dean both of Buckhannon.
2 CONT
2 CONT Those attending the open house celebration were: Mrs. Ima McIntire; Mr and Mrs. Ray Dean and daughter, Shirley, Grant Dean and sons, Franklin, Jackie and Michael; Mr. and Mrs. Dexter Dean and children, David, Margaret, Dewayne and
2 CONC  Gary; Mr. and Mrs. Virgil Dean and children, Terry and Marilyn; Mr. and Mrs. Robert Nesbitt and Mr. and Mrs. James Dean
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. McIntire and Mrs. Nesbitt were hostess.
2 CONT .* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/36986043/archibald-dean Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 1 2023, 5:31:10 UTC''
