1 NAME Stewart Litle /Queen/
2 GIVN Stewart Litle
2 SURN Queen
2 _MARNM Queen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 19 APR 1822
2 ADDR
3 CITY Chariott's Fork
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 12 MAR 1894
2 ADDR
3 CITY Peck's Run
3 STAE West Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 BURI
2 DATE 14 MAR 1894
2 ADDR
