2 CONT Stephen Post Queen and his wife Virginia Catherine Bennett were second cousins once removed, so they were both descended from Charles MacQueen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen Post Queen was the 3rd.great-grandson of Charles MacQueen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Virginia Catherine Bennett was the 2nd.great-grand daughter of Charles MacQueen.
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTES FOR STEPHEN POST QUEEN:  Stephen Post Queen owned a farm of 253 acres on Kinchelo Creek, Lewis County West Virginia., and he raised quite a lot of stock; hogs, sheep, cattle and horses, also a lot of wheat,oats, corn, and ha
2 CONC y.
2 CONT
