2 CONT Catherine was born to Johann George b 25 Mar 1749 d 1804 and Mary Reger b 1749. In his will probated 11 Apr 1804 in Hardy County, WV, in his will written in 1802, says Catherine is a Rodabaugh. Her name is listed also "Catherine S
2 CONC ilver" in "The Radabaugh Family," central WV Counties, pg 23, by Doris and Mary Radabaugh, 27 Jul 1996. Catherine Silver , age 75, is listed in the 1850 Upshur cenus with son Jacob Radabaugh's family.
