1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sarah Radabaugh Mowery BIRTH	11 Apr 1841 Harrison County, West Virginia, USA DEATH	2 Nov 1923 (aged 82) Upshur County, West Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Old Baptist Cemetery Upshur County, West Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/158863364
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was married three times, 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st Jasper Lanham 1860, 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd Benjamin Coffman 31 Aug 1889 
2 CONT
2 CONT and 3rd George Mowery 18 Oct 1894. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her birth date is questionable, some records show 11 April 1841, however on the W VA "Death" Certificate (No 15443)is 12 March 1838 85 yrs 7mos 20 days and her death date is given as 2 November 1923. Her death record gives her age
2 CONC  as 87yrs 7 mos 20 days, which calculates to a birth date of 13 March 1836. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her death certificate reads that she was "married" at the time of death. She was living with her daughter in Buckhannon at that time, not with her 3rd husband. Records show George was born 1828 Pendleton, W VA and died Reger, Upsh
2 CONC ur County, W VA. of Grippe and buried Mowery Cemetery. After all this is stated her parents married in 1840.
