2 CONT Henry2 Jackson (John1) was born 10 July 1774 near Buckhannon, now Upshur County, (West) Virginia, and died 24 February 1852 in Upshur County, (West) Virginia. He married (1) Mary Elizabeth Hyre 20 May 1800 probably near Buckhannon
2 CONC , now Upshur County, (West) Virginia, daughter of Jacob Hyre and Elizabeth Powers. She was born 04 June 1784 in now Upshur County, (West) Virginia, and died 17 January 1835 in Upshur County, (West) Virginia. Burial: Heavner Cemete
2 CONC ry, Buckhannon, Upshur County, West Virginia. He married (2) Elizabeth "Betsy" Shreve 24 April 1836 in Loudoun County, Virginia, daughter of Joseph Shreve and Elizabeth Brake. She was born 10 December 1813 in Harrison/now Lewis Co
2 CONC unty, West Virginia, and died 11 April 1887 in probably Upshur County, West Virginia. Henry and Elizabeth are buried Henry Jackson Cemetery, near Hall, Upshur County, West Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Henry Jackson and Mary Hyre are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 i. Ester3 Jackson, born 31 March 1801 in (West) Virginia; died 27 June 1835 in (West) Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Aft. 27 June 1835, Henry Jackson Cemetery, near Hall, Upshur County, West Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT + 3 ii. Elizabeth Permelia Jackson, born 22 November 1802 in Randolph/now Upshur County, (West) Virginia; died 09 February 1862 in probably Ritchie County, (West) Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4 iii. William Vandevater Jackson, born 27 October 1804 in (West) Virginia; died in West. He married Sarah Catherine Lewis 28 December 1827; born in Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 5 iv. Hyer Jackson, born 03 September 1806 in (West) Virginia; died 11 June 1873 in Hillsboro, Washington County, Oregon.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6 v. Edward Cummins Jackson, born 07 November 1808 in (West) Virginia; died 27 July 1851 near Fort Hall, Wyoming. He was killed by the Indians on the way to Oregon.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7 vi. Mary "Mariah" Jackson, born 21 March 1810 in (West) Virginia; died 15 November 1814.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 8 vii. Henry J. Jackson, Jr., born 11 August 1813 in (West) Virginia; died 24 July 1865 in Racine, Mason County, (West) Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 9 viii. Amanda Melvina Jackson, born 04 February 1816 in (West) Virginia; died 28 January 1902 in (West) Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 10 ix. Rachel Cecelia Jackson, born 10 December 1817 near Buckhannon, now Upshur County, (West) Virginia; died 30 January 1912 in Woodland, Oregon.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 11 x. John Henderson Brake Jackson, born 15 March 1820 in Wood County, (West) Virginia; died 22 December 1869 in Centerville, Oregon.
2 CONT
2 CONT 12 xi. Jacob Jackson, born 27 October 1821 in probably Wood County, (West) Virginia; died 27 February 1823 in probably Wood County, (West) Virginia. Burial: Henry Jackson Cemetery, near Hall, Upshur County, West Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 13 xii. Ulysses Jackson, born 06 November 1824 in Wood County, (West) Virginia,; died 22 December 1882 in Washington County, Oregon.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 14 xiii. Mary Sophia Madelena Rosa Janis Jackson, born 20 September 1827 near Parkersburg, Wood County, (West) Virginia; died 24 February 1906 in Dubuque County, Iowa.
2 CONT
