2 CONT Photo: Bush ancestral home, known as Bush Inn, near Grass Run, on old US 33 between McGuire Park & Horner, Lewis County WV. Boyhood home of Jacob Hamilton Bush, to which he took his 16 year old bride, Cecilia Jackson, and where th
2 CONC ey had 11 children. Home demolished early 21st century. -by: hawk41, 1/19/2015
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [1st Husband] Jacob Bush and his 16 year old bride eloped, without the knowledge of their parents, and went to Ohio to be married. Each had a family member accompany them to witness the marriage. He is listed on the Lewis County d
2 CONC eath record as a farmer, and as having died of an unspecified accident. According to the late grand-daughter Shirley Bush Fulks, he died of blood poisoning (septicemia) following an ax injury. He and Cecilia had 11 children at the
2 CONC  time of his death. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd Husband:George Henry Bonnett
