2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=32604859
2 CONT
2 CONT FATHER - JOSHUA WARD (born in Ireland) MOTHER - ELIZABETH UNKNOWN
2 CONT
2 CONT SPOUSE - TABITHA ELIZABETH CUMMINS MARRIED - ABT 1789 LOUDOUN CO, VA
2 CONT
2 CONT We do know from Job's tombstone in the "Ward Family Cemetery" at Century No. 2, Volga, Barbour County, WV that he died 29 Dec 1831 in his 66th year. This would indicate he was born abt 1765. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Also from her tombstone his wife Tabitha Cummins who died 17 November 1856 in her 92nd year. This would indicate she was born abt 1764. Her entry in the Barbour County, WV Death Records states she was born in Loudoun County, VA.
2 CONT
