1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Ward was the constable of Upshur County in 1851
2 CONT
2 CONT Bio by: Whispers Record added: Jun 15, 2015  Find A Grave Memorial# 147902220
2 CONT
2 CONT John Ward BIRTH	5 Apr 1797 Loudoun County, Virginia, USA DEATH	11 Jan 1868 (aged 70) Upshur County, West Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Ward Methodist Church Cemetery Century, Barbour County, West Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=147902220
2 CONT
2 CONT "Nancy Osborn, born July 28, 1799 in Loudon County, Virginia; died September 2, 1856 in Barbour County, Virginia ... She married John Ward November 12, 1819 in Harrison County, Virginia, son of Job(e) Ward and Tabitha Cummins. He 
2 CONC was born 1797 in Loudon County, Virginia, and died January 11, 1868 in Sugar Fork, Upshur County, West Virginia... John Ward was the constable of Upshur County in 1851." ~ Ancestors of Munza & deVaux Families
2 CONT
2 CONT West Virginia County Marriages: Marriage 12 Nov 1819 Harrison, West Virginia Groom John Ward Bride Nancy Osburn Father Joseph Osburn
2 CONT
2 CONT 1850 US Census: Barbour county, Barbour, Virginia John Ward 53 Virginia Nancy Ward 50 Virginia Anthony Ward 21 Virginia Jackson Ward 15 Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy died in 1856, and John married a 2nd time to widow Elizabeth Keesling Strader.
2 CONT
2 CONT West Virginia Marriages, 1780-1970: Marriage 29 Aug 1857 Upshur County, West Virginia Groom John Ward Age 60 years 4 months 24 days Birth Year (Est) 1797 Parents Job and Tabatha Ward Bride Elizabeth Strader Age 58 years 6 months 5
2 CONC  days Birth Year (Est) 1799 Parents Jacob and Mary Keesling
2 CONT
2 CONT 1860 US Census: Upshur, Virginia John Ward 63 Virginia Elizabeth Ward 61 Virginia
