2 CONT SPOUSE - WILLIAM TURNER CHRISLIP MARRIED - 10 JAN 1822 UPSHUR CO, WV
2 CONT
2 CONT Their marriage was recorded in Harrison County on January 7, 1823. The entry shows her name as Hannah Ward Daniel, an indication that this was not her first marriage. Their marriage was "solemnized by the Rev. Shadrack Johnson, Mi
2 CONC nister of the Gospel." William's signature shows that he used the surname spelling CHRISLIP.
2 CONT
