2 CONT According to Aquilla Ward's Roane County, WV death record [1857] he was the son of J. Ward and Tabitha Cumming. His TS gives date of death as 1858. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He and Zillah Greathouse were married  Dec. 28, 1827 in Harrison County, VA(WV)and were living in Barbour County for the 1850 census, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Zilla was listed in 1860 census of Roane Co. w/ 4 children still at home. 
