1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John George Dahmer BIRTH	1 May 1775 Baden-Württemberg, Germany DEATH	10 May 1842 (aged 67) Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Dahmer Cemetery #4 Upper Tract, Pendleton County, West Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/85115895/john-george-dahmer
