2 CONT The subject of this sketch, familiarly known as Joe Dahmer, died suddenly while eating the noon day meal at his home in Buffalo Hills Thursday and was buried Saturday.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had been married twice, first to a Miss. Teter to which two children were born, later to Miss. Susan Simmons, daughter of the late Jacob Simmons and by which four children were born, all of which survive.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a good citizen, sixty seven years of age, and had many friends throughout the county, by whom he will be missed.
2 CONT
2 CONT {Abstracted from Pendleton County Obituaries}
