1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Andrew Dolly BIRTH	1792 Virginia, USA DEATH	1866 (aged 73–74) Grant County, West Virginia, USA BURIAL	Unknown 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/82700856/andrew-dolly
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew Dolly was born in Pendleton Co., Virginia (now West Virginia), the eldest son of John and Mary (Shoulders) Dolly. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Susannah Smith and settled on a farm deeded by his father near what is now the Pendleton/Grant county line. There were several children, notably West Virginia founding father Abijah Dolly. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Tradition asserts that he was the first family member to be associated with the Dolly Sods, scenic and conservation area of the Monongahela National Forest. (Bio by Mark Hale, citing SUNRISE ON DOLLY SODS)
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Parents:
2 CONT *John Dolly (1749 - 1847)
2 CONT *Mary Shoulders Dolly (1767 - 1838)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT *Abijah Dolly (1817 - 1898)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Mark Hale Record added: Dec 30, 2011 Find A Grave Memorial# 82700856
