1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margaret Cox (1758-1832) was a daughter of Isaac Cox & Susannah Tomlinson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Robert I "Robin" Everett (1750-1827).  They married 7/2/1783 at Rockbridge County, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret was the widow of Thomas Lockhart, a Revolutionary War soldier & friend of Robert's with 1 son, Charles Lockhart who he raised as his own.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert & Margaret had 10 children: 
2 CONT
