1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Name: FILBERT, Samuel
2 CONT * Died: 1794
2 CONT * OBITUARY:
2 CONT * Abstract of Will from Berks County Court House, PA 
2 CONT * Samuel Filbert of Heidelberg
2 CONT * Signed - 13 Dec 1794
2 CONT * Probated - 7 Jan 1795
2 CONT
2 CONT Provides for wife Sibilla 1/2 of all estate and the other 1/2 to sons Joseph and Peter. <br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Executors and guardians of sons - father Philip Filbert and father-in-law Francis Umbehacker <br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Witnesses - Tobias Bochle and Philip Filbert Jr.
2 CONT
