1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born and Raised in Berks County till he moved to Lebanon County, PA  in 1869.  Percival Strauss was a Hotelkeeper in Lebanon County till about 1895 when he retired and moved back to Berks County and resided there u
2 CONC ntil his death.  
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 July 1918: Funeral services for the late P.L. Strauss, of Mohnton, Berks County, were conducted Tuesday by the Rev. Owen Reber, of Mohnton. Mr. Strauss was a prominent resident of Fredericksburg for many years. Burial was made i
2 CONC n the Cedar Hill Cemetery, Fredericksburg. The obsequies were widely attended. [Lebanon Daily News]* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/7027652/percival-long-strauss Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/proj
2 CONC ects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 9 2019, 1:19:50 UTC''
