1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/186170660/anna-sophia-ruth
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Sophia (Lauer) Roudt/Ruth daughter of Hans Pieter Lauer and wife Maria Barbel (Cole) Later of Wolfersweiler, Saarland, Germany. 1733-Sophia arrived in Philadelphia with husband Johan Peter Roudt/Ruth and 4-sons-Michael-Jakob-
2 CONC Christian and Peter Jr. Also arriving with the Ruth family were Sophia's Brother Christian Lauer and Sophia's Sister Margaretha Barbel Later. Sophia died in 1735 during childbirth of daughter Catherina. Sophia (Later) Roudt is bur
2 CONC ied in Tulpehocken Trinity U.C.C. Old Churchyard (no tombstone). Also buried in Tulpehocken Trinity U.C.C. Old Churchyard are related Families-Ruth-Lauer-Theiss-Spucker-Eckert-Siebol. Book-The Descendants of Peter and Sophia (late
2 CONC r) Ruth-by Jack Akerboom and Anna Ruth Salzman-printed in 1994
2 CONT --------------------
