2 CONT
2 CONT Shirley attended Lynchburg College in Virginia before her marriage.  The family lived on a farm near Hinton, VA prior to moving to Greeley, CO where the children were raised.  She and the children frequently came to Pendleton coun
2 CONC ty to visit.
2 CONT
