2 CONT JEHU ICHELL CHENOWETH (1792- 1888
2 CONT
2 CONT Jehu Ichell Chenoweth was born in Hampshire Co., Virginia, fourth son and seventh child of John and Mary Pugh Chenoweth. He came with his parents to Randolph County before the age of 3. He would grow up and live here the rest of h
2 CONC is life. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jehu married, at the age of 21, Eleanor 'Nelley', the daughter of Andrew Skidmore and Margaret Johnson. Nelley was a sister to the wife of Jehu's brother, John, and a cousin to Edith, the wife of his oldest brother Robert. Like hi
2 CONC s brother John, Jehu was a farmer and all of his nine children were born in Randolph County. 
2 CONT
2 CONT When the youngest child was twelve, Eleanor died. Jehu remarried the following year to the widow, Mary Jane Hamilton nee Peterose. This marriage occurred September 24, 1850, after the 1850 Census, when this family is found in the 
2 CONC 52nd district of Randolph County. Eleven Chenoweth households are found in this district, all clustered together, including the four brothers: William Pugh, John, Jehu and Gabriel and some of their children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jehu's son, Edward Pugh, would die a civilian hostage during the Civil War. Jehu outlived his second wife as well, dying at about 96 years of age. Jehu and his first wife, Nellie, are both buried in the Chenoweth cemetery, south o
2 CONC f Elkins, WV, known as Daniel's Graveyard. Many of the descendants of this family still live in Randolph Co.
2 CONT
2 CONT CENSUS: 1820 VA: Randolph Co: page 266, 1830 VA: Randolph Co: page 105, 1840 VA: Randolph Co: page 253, 1850 VA: Randolph Co: 52nd district: page 71, 1860 VA: Randolph Co, 1870 WV: Randolph Co: Beverly twp: page 413, 1880 WV: Rand
2 CONC olph Co: Beverly: page 240C  LOCATIONS: Randolph Co., VA (now WV)  BOOKS: Harris page 63, Hiatt page 86 (misplaced), Cecil Stalnaker: Stalnaker Family Chronology, Odie Velta Chapman: They Rest Quietly, cemetery records of Randolph
2 CONC  Co., WV  OTHER SOURCES: Randolph Co., WV research of Virginia Bird Johnson, Peter Chenoweth of Georgia, Phares File: Richard Phares, Lois P. McDaniel, Carol Anne Yount, Rhonda McDonald, Noel Edwin Chenoweth, Robert Adair, Rodney 
2 CONC H. Chenoweth, Carol Chenoweth Reice, Curtis L. Daniels, Nicole Marie Chenoweth, Jason Boone Chenoweth, Virginia Pearl Chenoweth, Martha Fleshman, James Rodney Chenoweth, Margaret Talbott Chenoweth, Mark Eugene Chenoweth, Mary C. D
2 CONC ulaney, Stetson Holt Chenoweth, research of Jane Shaw of Ohio, Sharon R. Matthew of Elkins, Ken Rowan of Ohio, Joyce Corns Wiegand of Indiana and Dot Tucker-Houk, Maryland, internet contacts: Thomas E. King and Sandra Ragan, inter
2 CONC net sites: Jackie L. White & Stephanie Nicole Castle, Allegheny Regional Family History Society, WFT Vol 9 # 2611, WFT Vol 18 # 0156, WFT Vol 21 # 1830, WFT Vol 29 # 1225  OTHER COUSIN CONTACTS: Roger Clair Chenoweth, Richard Alle
2 CONC n Cox, Karen Elaine Shaffer
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JEHU CHENOWETH and ELEANOR SKIDMORE are:
2 CONT * Margaret 'Peggy' b. January 1815, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. November 11, 1888, prob. Randolph Co., WV; m. THOMAS JEFFERSON CAPLINGER, December 04, 1834, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. August 29, 1806, Elkins, Randolph Co., VA
2 CONC  (now WV); d. July 29, 1884, prob. Randolph Co., WV.
2 CONT * James b. March 21, 1819, Elkins, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. September 14, 1889, Randolph Co., WV; m. MARY HELMICK; b. Abt. 1815, Virginia; d. Unknown.
2 CONT * Everett b. September 12, 1821, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. December 13, 1898, Randolph Co., WV; m. VIRGINIA A. HYRE, February 05, 1846, Lick, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. September 02, 1826, Lick, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d
2 CONC . February 23, 1913, Randolph Co., WV.
2 CONT * Edward Pugh b. 1824, Chenoweth Creek, Beverly, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. 1863, Fort Delaware prison, near Philadelphia, PA; m. MARTHA JANE SALISBURY, May 28, 1849, Elkins, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. October 15, 1831, Beve
2 CONC rly, Randolph Co., WV; d. July 31, 1911, Elkins, Randolph Co., WV.
2 CONT * Cyrus Pepper b. July 11, 1826, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. January 30, 1897, Barbour Co., WV; m. (1) JUDITH SALISBURY, December 30, 1847, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. 1828, Virginia; d. June 09, 1851, Randolph Co., VA (now WV
2 CONC ); m. (2) SUSAN REEDER, June 05, 1855, Upshur Co., VA (now WV); b. November 18, 1834, Virginia (now WV); d. February 22, 1919, Barbour Co., WV.
2 CONT * Rachel A. b. March 20, 1829, Elkins, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. December 04, 1885, Roaring Creek, Randolph Co., WV; m. JOHN ADDISON ROWAN, June 27, 1849, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. March 24, 1828, Roaring Creek, Randolph C
2 CONC o., VA (now WV); d. September 22, 1912, Mabie, Randolph Co., WV.
2 CONT * John Skidmore 'JS' b. September 27, 1831, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. February 11, 1898, Randolph Co., WV; m. DEBORAH FERRIS WEES, May 27, 1856, Elkins, Randolph Co., VA (Now WV); b. May 04, 1839, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d.
2 CONC  February 28, 1918, Randolph Co., WV.
2 CONT * Mary Ellen b. March 22, 1837, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. April 02, 1916, Randolph Co., WV; m. ELI HOWARD ROWAN, September 09, 1855, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. April 02, 1834, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. April 27, 1911, M
2 CONC abie, Randolph Co., WV.
2 CONT * Jehu b. Aft. 1813; d. September 08, 1835.
2 CONT
