1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johann Ludwig “Lewis” Zirkle BIRTH	9 Oct 1705 Ittlingen, Landkreis Heilbronn, Baden-Württemberg, Germany DEATH	10 Mar 1747 (aged 41) Franconia, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania, USA BURIAL	 Little Zion Lutheran Chur
