1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria Margareta “Margaret” Zirkle Nehs BIRTH	6 Mar 1736 Telford, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania, USA DEATH	13 Apr 1796 (aged 60) Forestville, Shenandoah County, Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Solomons Lutheran Church Cemet
2 CONC ery Forestville, Shenandoah County, Virginia
