2 CONT
2 CONT Lewis Zirkle BIRTH	1740 Telford, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania, USA DEATH	22 Jan 1815 (aged 74–75) New Market, Shenandoah County, Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Saint Matthews Cemetery New Market, Shenandoah County, Virginia
2 CONT
