2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 10 Jan 1770 in Virginia,  Died: 19 May 1851 in Ohio,  Buried: Pence Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Philip Roush Mother: Catherine Kelchner
2 CONT
2 CONT Susannah was first married to John Zirkle son of Michael Zirkle Sr  28 Nov 1788 Shenandoah Co. They had one daughter Lydia
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd marriage Peter 31 December 1792 in Shenandoah County, Virginia 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Cook signed the bond
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT   George C Pence (1793 - 1873)
