1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Charles Richard Gordon
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Birth: 	Dec. 12, 1774 Rockingham County Virginia, USA Death: 	Dec. 17, 1857 Clark County Ohio, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Farmer. Son of Giles Richard and Catherine Gordon. Married Anna Garst on 15 Jan 1801 in Botetourt County, VA. Father of John b. 15 Feb 1802, James b. 27 Sep 1803, William b. 14 Jan 1805, Andrew b. 17 Nov 1806, Lettie b. 2 Dec 1808
2 CONC , Giles b. 3/10 Mar 1810, Anna b. 23 Jul 1811, Eliza b. 10 Mar 1813, Mary Ann b. 14 Dec 1814, Charles Richard b. 9 Feb 1816, Catherine b. 15 May 1818, George Washington b. 7 Jun 1820, Mazy b. 13 Mar 1822, Sarah b. 18 Jan 1824, Dav
2 CONC id b. 15 Nov 1825, Frederick b. 10 Jun 1827 and Delilah b. 13 Mar 1829.  
2 CONT
