1 NOTE {geni:about_me} EXCERPT from -The Burkhart - Burkett Family in America, A history of the Ancestors and Descendants of Johann Jacob Burkhardt 1712 - 1794 by Bess Burkett Hill. "Since Johann Jacob, our German Ancestor, was just 10 y
2 CONC ears old when his  mother died, it seems logical to assume that he went to live with his grandfather Schneider in Fleinheim and there learned the art of weaving, for when he arrived in Amerca in 1754 he was listed as a master weav
2 CONC er. "  __________ 
2 CONT
2 CONT PENNSYLVANIA ARCHIVES, 3rd Series Volume 18 
2 CONT
