2 CONT DEATH RECORD of Trinity Lutheran church, Reading Pa -- John Jacob Burkhardt,  Born October 9, 1712. His father was Andrew Burkhardt, a master mason of Wurtemburg, Germany and his mother was Margaret, (nee - Schneider. Married to S
2 CONC abina Dorthea Naegeli for 42 years and 6 months."  Seven children 3 sons and 4 daughters (three not named in records)  Two sons and one daughter still living and married.  Died - April 12, 1794 - aged 81 years, 6 months, 2 days." 
2 CONC  __________ 
2 CONT
2 CONT WILL filed April 23, 1794 recorded in the Register of Wills, Office of Berks County, in Will Book Vol. 3, Page 215. Will recorded in German Language with English translation. 
2 CONT
2 CONT "I, Jacob Burkhardt, have resolved to make my last will because I am much of age and in years, that, after my death, no difference or disturbance may arise  between my children, therefore, I will that my wife Sabina Dorthea by wri
2 CONC ting shall grant all that I have after my death as namely, the house and the half lot  whereon the house stands and from the other half lot the half of the apple trees and also what I have shall remain in her hands until her decea
2 CONC se and my children  shall have no demand thereon until my wife's death. And this is my will, there so help me God. signed Jacob Burkhardt. Witnesses: George Geissler, Nicholas  Schell"  __________ 
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Johann Jacob Burkhardt:  Age at Death (Facts Pg): 81years, 6 months, 2 days.  Emigration 1: September 22, 1752, Halifax arrived Philadelphia from Basel  Switzerland.  Emigration 2: October 01, 1754, Ship, Phoenix, John 
2 CONC Spurrier, Master. Arrived Philadelphia.  Occupation: Master weaver.  Religion: Lutheran, Trinity Lutheran Church, Reading, PA.  Will: 1794, Berks County, Pennsylvania Admin Letters Book 4 page 401, Will BookA, page 297, AD. c.t.a.
2 CONC  Book 3 page 218. 
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Johann Jacob Burkhardt and Sabina Dorthea Naegeli: Marriage: Abt. November 12, 1751, Germany.  Marriage Fact: Married 42 years, 4 months. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Johann Jacob Burkhardt and Sabina Dorthea Naegeli are: i.+John George Burkhardt-Burkett, b. March 09, 1755, Berks County, Pennsylvania, d.  January 02, 1847, Hessville, Sandusky County, Ohio.  ii.John Burkhardt, b. Aug
2 CONC ust 11, 1756, d. 1756.  iii.+John Jacob Burkhardt, b. May 08, 1758, Reading, Berks County, Pennsylvania, d. date unknown.  iv.Margaret Catherine Burkhardt, b. September 13, 1759, d. date unknown 
2 CONT
