1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johannes (Johann) Ziemer Esq. was born on 24 Dec 1771 in Brecknock, Berks, Pennsylvania, USA (Baptism rec.; 1773 in Adler. NOT JOHANNES HENRICH despite what Ancestry trees have! as the first child of Johan Heinrich
2 CONC  Ziemer Sr. and Anna Catharina Scharman). He had five siblings, namely: Catherine, Jeremiah, Peter, Johannes Heinrich, and Andreas. He died on 26 Jul 1831 in Brecknock, Berks, Pennsylvania, USA (Adler death notice).
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes (Johann) Ziemer Esq. was baptized on 15 Jan 1772 in Brecknock, Berks, Pennsylvania, USA (Allegheny Ref. Ch.; was wrong, this is his bapt. rec.). He signed his will between 23 Jul–03 Sep 1831 in Brecknock, Berks, Pennsylva
2 CONC nia, USA (Dates written & proved. Admin wife & son Jeremiah). He was buried after 26 Jul 1831 in Alleghenyville, Berks, Pennsylvania, USA (Allegheny Reformed Church Cemetery). He was employed as a Farmer, Lawyer.
