1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In reminiscencing, Clay Jones told about Catherine Dodd Lawson, an aunt of Melvin Dodds saying, "Catherine Lawson was the only woman I ever saw die and being brought back to life. Someone rode on horseback to town 
2 CONC for the doctor, he blew his breath into her mouth, worked her sides and finally she breathed again then messaged her and walked her until she finally came to and lived for a long time".
