1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary Templeton JONES
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Lucy Dodd Miller's notes: She was called "Polly", like her mother.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 5 Feb 1815 - Tennessee
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 4 Jun 1906 - Loami, Loami Township, Sangamon County, Illinois
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried:  - Sulpher Spring Cemetery, Loami Township, Sangamon County, Illinois
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Joshua Bingham * JONES, Sr. (Abt 1763-1830)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Mary "Polly" * TEMPLETON (Abt 1782-1815)
2 CONT
2 CONT Noted events in her life were:
2 CONT
2 CONT • Alt. Birth, 24 Feb 1815 - North Carolina 
2 CONT
2 CONT • Alt. Birth, 1816 - Springfield, Sangamon County, Illinois 
2 CONT
2 CONT • Migration, from Bradley County, Tennessee to a farm east of, 1851-1852 - Loami Township, Sangamon County, Illinois 
2 CONT
2 CONT from Bradley County, Tennessee with her husband, Charles DODD's brothers and their families 
2 CONT
2 CONT • Census, United States Federal, 5 Aug 1870 - Loami Township, Sangamon County, Illinois 
