2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah 24 F TN
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles 22 M TN
2 CONT
2 CONT Jessee W 14 M IL
2 CONT
2 CONT KITCHEN Henry 18 M farm laborer TN
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles and Henry cannot read or write.
2 CONT
2 CONT Polly cannot write.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse is attending school. 
2 CONT
