1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Albert Jesse Obenchain died in hospital at Vincennes, Indiana. His death was due to anemia and carcinoma of the pancreas. He was taken to the hospital on Friday, January 1, 1937 and passed away January 4th. His age
2 CONC  at death was 55 years, 5 months and 14 days. The deceased was born and spent his entire life on the farm in Allison Township, Lawrence County, Illinois. He married Lulu Grace Fry in 1910. She preceeded him in death in 1922 of can
2 CONC cer at the age of 33 years, 1 month and 18 days. To this union five children were born.
