1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Oma Ann Obenchain was born April 21. 1886 in Lawrence County, Illinois. She died at her home at 6 p.m. after a lengthy illness. She was a lifelong resident of Allison Prairie and a member of the Church of the Breth
2 CONC ren. She was married to Adam Evan Jellison on September 10, 1910. He was the son of James H and Esther Gerhart Jellison.
