2 CONT  Harriet Gritton was the daughter of Jacob Gritton and Julia Ann Obenchain.1 Harriet Gritton was born circa 1854 at Quasqueton, Buchanan County, Iowa.1 She married John T Small on 4 April 1882 at Buchanan County, Iowa.1 Harriet Gr
2 CONC itton married David Thomas Bowers, son of Solomon Bowers and Suanna Lawver, on 27 February 1886 at Buchanan County, Iowa.1 Harriet Gritton died on 7 September 1898 at Strawberry Point, Clayton County, Iowa.1 She was buried at Stra
2 CONC wberry Point, Clayton County, Iowa. 
2 CONT      Her married name was Bowers.1 Her married name was Small.1
2 CONT      Children of Harriet Gritton and David Thomas Bowers: James Bowers   b. c 1886, d. 22 Nov 1894  Joseph Amesie Bowers+   b. 6 Oct 1887, d. 18 May 1950  Susan Bowers   b. c 1892, d. Jan 1928  Russel Emmett Bowers   b. 24 Sep 189
2 CONC 3, d. 2 Dec 1971  Nellie Elizabeth Bowers   b. 13 Jan 1896, d. 25 Dec 1964  Claude Bowers   b. c 1897, d. 20 Aug 1898
