1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jenevery "Jennie" Obenchain Wilson Memorial Photos Flowers Edit Share Learn about sponsoring this memorial... Birth: 	Aug. 21, 1862 California, USA Death: 	Apr. 23, 1924 Klamath Falls Klamath County Oregon, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Bartlet Obenchain and Nancy Morse Obenchain from Pennsylvania. Wife of Jeff Wilson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Aged 62 years 8 months 2 days, hemorrhage of spinal cord due to auto accident.
2 CONT *******************************
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Jefferson Wilson married Jennie Obenchian on September 13, 1882. In 1880 Jeff and Jennie had a house built on the West side of Langell Valley about a mile north of the George and Mary McDonald ranch. Jeff and Jennie had no 
2 CONC children.
2 CONT
2 CONT In April 1924, Jeff and Jennie were driving from Langell Valley when Jeff rolled his car near Harpold Dam. Jennie died a few days later on April 24, 1924. 
