1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Herald & News, Klamath Falls, Oregon, February 3, 1975
2 CONT Pearl Obenchain McNair, 74, died in this city February 1, 1975. She is survived by sons, Wilbur Hixon, Eugene, Ore; Lee Hixon, this city; Dale McNair, this city; and Ray Faithful, this city. Funeral services will be held Thursday,
2 CONC  February 6, 1975, at 10 a.m. in O'Hair's Funeral Chapel. Private concluding services will follow at the Chief Schonchin Cemetery.
2 CONT +++++++++
2 CONT Herald & News
2 CONT Klamath Falls, Oregon
2 CONT February 5, 1975
2 CONT Funeral services for Pearl Obenchain McNair will be held Thursday, February 6, 1975 in O'Hair's Funeral Chapel. Private concluding services will be in the Chief Schonchin Cemetery.
