1 NAME Tunice Wayne /McElwain/
2 GIVN Tunice Wayne
2 SURN McElwain
2 _MARNM Mucklewain
2 NICK Tunice Mucklewain
2 NICK Tunis Anthony McElwain
2 NICK Wain
2 NICK McIlwain
2 NICK Mucklewaine
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 19 AUG 1773
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stonewall
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 BURI
2 DATE AFT 4 NOV 1851
2 PLAC Winner Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Lee District
3 STAE West Virginia
3 CTRY United States
