2 CONT Margaret Ann BIRD married 1st at Bath Co., VA on 28 Dec 1837 to William Abraham MULLENAX of Pendleton Co., VA. They had five children: George W., Elizabeth A., Samuel B., Matilda F. and Mary J. MULLENAX.
2 CONT ---
2 CONT She married 2nd in 1853 to John COOK of Roanoke, VA. Their son, David Bird COOK, born 1859 married Elizabeth CONRAD and had eight children.
