2 CONT Born in Pocahontas County Va (now WV) to Jas. & Elizth. Tallman. Died at Crabbottom, Va of pneumonia. Wife of Peter Hull (deceased) Reported by here son Matthew H. Hull. P. 71 Death Records of Highland. P. 304 Morton's History of 
2 CONC Highland list her as Rachel Crawford of Pocahontas
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ''' '''Rachel married Peter Adam Hull on 10 Sep 1816 in Bath Co VA.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Rachel's death was reported by her son Matthew Hull   p71  ''Death Records of Highland County.'''''
