2 CONC ted)    -    on rolls 31 Aug 1864 (place not stated)   -    issued clothing 15 Sep 1864  (place not stated.)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Others:    born 3 Nov 1839    -     died 17 Jan 1925 Cass WV     -   Buried Warwick Cemetery Green Bank WV     -  '''married:  Sarah C Matheny  13 Nov 1865'''
