2 CONT '''John R Warwick    -    residence: Pocahontas Co     -     19 year old farmer '''  Enlisted 29 May 1861 at Green Bank as a Corporal. '''29 May 1861 mustered into "G" Co  VA 31st Infantry '''Listed as:   -   at home sick 31 Aug 1
