2 CONT   -   furloughed 18 Feb 1863 (place not stated)     -     returned 8 May 1863  (place not stated     -    requested clothing 30 Jul 1863  (place not stated)     -    issued pay  31 Dec 1863 (place not stated)     -   issued pay 29
2 CONC  Feb 1863 (place not stated)     -     requested stationery 30 Jun 1864  (place not stated)     -     POW 20 Jul 1864  Stephenson's Depot VA     -     Confined 24 Jul 1864  Atheneum Prison Wheeling     -     Confined 28 Jul 1864 C
2 CONC amp Chase OH     -    
2 CONT  Confined 2 May 1865  City Point VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Promotion:  4 Aug 1863 -   First Lieut.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Described at Enlistment:  5'10" ,  fair complexion,  blue eyes.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Alive in 1910.     .      After the War he lived in Pocahontas Co WV.''
