1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Photo added by callinvin
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/104201412
2 CONT
2 CONT George Cain Hoover BIRTH	1807 Greenbrier County, West Virginia, USA DEATH	4 Jul 1896 (aged 88–89) Braxton County, West Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Hoover Cemetery Sutton, Braxton County, West Virginia, USA  MEMORIAL ID	104201412
2 CONT
2 CONT Cain was born in Greenbrier County Virginia (later became West Virginia) and died in Bug Ridge, Braxton County, West Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to Susan A Keister 17 June 1830.* 
2 CONT
2 CONT Cain was the first to Homestead property in the area of the Hoover Cemetary and the first to be buried in the that same cemetery. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife: Susan A Keister Hoover 1811–1894 (m. 1830)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Different date of marriage in this source:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://hackerscreek.com/norman/HOOVER/SEBASTIAN.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Cain Hoover, a son of Henry and Elizabeth (Hevener) Hoover, was born in VA about 1807 and died in Braxton County WV after 1880.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Susan Keister in Greenbrier County Va (WV) June 17, 1828. Susan, a daughter of George and Susannah (Peck) Keister, was born in Franklin, VA July 8, 1811 and died in Braxton County WV October 10, 1894.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Cain and Susan (Keister) Hoover.
2 CONT
2 CONT (1). William C.              b.Jan 24 1832   d.Jan 31 1897, m.Mary T. Brown
2 CONT
2 CONT (2). Elizabeth S.            b.c.     1834, m.Nathaniel Calvin Davis, m.Henry Clinton James
2 CONT
2 CONT (3). George Harvey           b.Jul 31 1836   d.Jun  7 1923, m.Arminta Caroline Duffield May 1 1856, m.Nancy Mae "Nannie" Mace Jan 22 1900
2 CONT
2 CONT (4). ?                       b.c.     1839
2 CONT
2 CONT (5). Sarah A.                b.c.     1841, m.Addison McLaughlin Brown Nov 25 1858
2 CONT
2 CONT (6). Margaret J.             b.c.     1843, m.Andrew S. Facemire Apr 24 1859
2 CONT
2 CONT (7). Mary Isabel             b.Feb 13 1845   d.Oct  2 1885, m.Adam Hyer Sutton Jan 28 1869
2 CONT
2 CONT (8). Archibald Cain          b.Jun  4 1847   d.Oct 24 1929, m.Isabella Caroline Brown Apr  4 1867
2 CONT
2 CONT (9). Virginia E.             b.c.     1849   d.Oct 11 1855
2 CONT
2 CONT (10). Evaline                 b.c.     1850, m.James P. Hefner Jan 23 1868
2 CONT
2 CONT  (11). James K.                b.Mar 29 1855   d.Mar 19 1926, m.Elizabeth Long Feb  8 1880, m.Elizabeth Halstead Apr 24 1890
2 CONT
2 CONT 5 of his 11 children are linked in Find A Grave: 	
2 CONT Elizabeth Sutton Hoover Davis 1832–1905
2 CONT
2 CONT George Harvey Hoover 1836–1923 	
2 CONT Mary Isabel Hoover Sutton 1845–1885
2 CONT
2 CONT James K. Hoover 1855–1926
