2 CONT
2 CONT James K. Hoover, a son of Cain and Susan (Keister) Hoover, was born in Braxton County VA (WV) March 29, 1855 and died in Nicholas County WV March 19, 1926.  
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st- He married Elizabeth Long in Braxton County February 8, 1880. Elizabeth was born March 22, 1862 and died March 19, 1888. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd- James married Elizabeth Halstead in Braxton County April 24, 1890. Elizabeth was born in Braxton County about 1870.
