2 CONC  October 16, 1752 in Elkton, Rockingham Co., Virginia; died July 16, 1834.   Notes for Henry Harnsberger: Henry is buried at Bridgewater, Rockingham Co., Virginia 
2 CONT *   11 ii.   Adam Bear, born Abt. 1759 in Elkton, Rockingham Co., Virginia.  
2 CONT *   12 iii.   Jacob Bear, born December 17, 1761 in Elkton, Rockingham Co., Virginia.  
2 CONT *   13 iv.   Anna Barbara Bear, born Abt. 1763 in Elkton, Rockingham Co., Virginia; died March 12, 1828.She married Jacob Kisling; born January 18, 1760; died May 23, 1835.  
2 CONT *   14 v.   Catherine Bear, born 1765 in Bear Lithia Springs, Botetourt, Rockingham Co., Virginia; died 1834 in Orangeville, Orange Co., In.She married Shirley Valentine.  + 15 vi.   Henry Bear, born 1765 in Rockingham City, Virgi
2 CONC nia.; died 1851 in Augusta, Virginia.  
2 CONT *   16 vii.   Elizabeth Bear, born 1767 in Elkton, Rockingham Co., Virginia.She married George Coogler.  
2 CONT *   17 viii.   Daughter? Bear, born Abt. 1769 in Elkton, Rockingham Co., Virginia.She married Michael Mallow.  
