2 CONT Daughter of Jacob Hermann Harmon Sr and Anna Catherina Pauschen
2 CONT
2 CONT ANNA BARBARA (HARMAN?) MALLO, married GEORGE MALLO; mother of Anna Elizabeth, Michael, Catherine, Anna Maria, John & George Mallo, Jr.; born 26 September 1726; died 17 January 1797, aged 70 years, 3 months, and 22 days; buried 19 
2 CONC January 1797, Peaked Mountain Church, Rockingham County, Virginia.[1] She was among the communicants at Peaked Mountain on 22 April 1792 She presented £5 for the use of the church, which (strangely) remained “in the hands of [her 
2 CONC son] George Mallo on 2 January 1802.[2]
2 CONT
