1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of Daniel and Mary Dean from Pendleton County, WV.  Daniel Dean moved to Boone County, Iowa. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married Elizabeth Teter Sept. 23, 1828. She died in 1858.
2 CONT
2 CONT Secondly, John J. Dean married Agnes Boggs (widow of Jacob McLaughin) in 1862. 
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: Conflicting info: DOD - Date of Death: (?) June 8 1854 - Braxton, Virginia, [now West Virginia]  United States, in many trees online but not possible.
