2 CONT John J. Dean BIRTH	1808 Pendleton County, West Virginia, USA DEATH	unknown BURIAL	 Given Cemetery Frametown, Braxton County, West Virginia,
2 CONT
2 CONT * John's Census records from 1850 and 1860 provides the names of the following 9 children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1870 Census John is living with Agnes, son John T. Dean, daughter Elizabeth and step son Jacob McLaughlin.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1880 Census records John Dean is living with 2nd wife Agnes, and beside his daughter Mary Dean Fox.
2 CONT
