2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/186366364/john-j.-dean
2 CONT Son of Daniel and Mary Dean from Pendleton County, WV. Daniel Dean moved to Boone County, Iowa. John married Elizabeth Teter Sept. 23, 1828. John J. Dean married Agnes Boggs (widow of Jacob McLaughin) in 1862. John census records 
2 CONC from 1850 and 1860 provides the names of the following 9 children. 1870 Census John is living with Agnes, son John T. Dean, daughter Elizabeth and step son Jacob McLaughlin. 1880 census records John Dean is living with 2nd wife Ag
