2 CONC an Teter Dean Hall 1845, Elizabeth Dean Frame 1848, John Taylor Dean 1851. Another possible daughter Martha Dean 1828 married Marshall Irvin in Braxton County and they moved to Iowa before 1860.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave
