1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of James Thornton Dean and Sarah Monger; husband of Frances Meadows
2 CONT
2 CONT William F. Dean died at 6 o'clock Saturday morning at his house on Dean's Mountain, in the Blue Ridge, two and a half miles east of Rainbow. He was 80 years old and was the father of 23 children. He leaves two brothers, Morgan and
2 CONC  Solomon Dean, both living in the vicinity of Dean's Mountain.
2 CONT
2 CONT The funeral was held Sunday afternoon, interment being made in the Solomon Dean graveyard. The services were conducted by Rev. Stephen Hensley, a minister of the Methodist church, of which Mr. Dean was a member.
2 CONT
2 CONT Harrisonburg Rockingham Register, May 10, 1907
