1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wesley married Delila Jane Shifflett on May 26, 1861 in Greene County, Va., and they lived on "Dean Mountain," which is now part of the Shenandoah National Park.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to family lore, Wesley argued with a man who had made a disrespectful remark about Wesley's wife and the man killed Wesley by striking him in the head with an ax.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is no stone for Wesley in the cemetery and his grave is most likely marked with a field stone.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/52743059/newton_wesley-dean Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/proje
