2 CONT Harrison Lair Dean was born circa 1855, West Virginia, to Ferdinand Lair Dean and Mahala Dean (born Crites). Ferdinand was born on November 13 1810, in Pendleton, West Virginia, United States. Mahala was born on January 24 1816, i
2 CONC n Buckhannon, Upshur, Virginia, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT Harrison married [1st] Florence Minerva Dean (born Shreve) in1876, at age 21, West Virginia. Florence was born on October 21 1858, in Upshur Co. WVa.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had 12 children: Emma Jeanette Dean, Ester L Dean and 10 other children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Harrison married [2nd] Ida Belle Bouroughs Dean (born Perkins) in 1934, at age 79, West Virginia. Ida was born on March 18 1862, in Indiana.
2 CONT
2 CONT Harrison married [3rd] Nora Virginia Dean (born McLaughlin) in 1936, at age 81, West Virginia. Nora was born on September 8 1876, in Braxton Co, WV.
2 CONT
