0 @N6000000000943803271@ NOTE MISS OVENSHINE TO WED.
1 CONT Gen Overshine's Daughter to Marry Capt. Norvell Next Month.
1 CONT Special to The New York Times.
1 CONT WASHINGTON, Sept. 13..ùGen.SamuelOvenshine, United States' Army,, and Mrs. Ovenshine announced this evening the engagement of their daughter, Mary, to Capt. Guy S. Norvell, United States Army, Thirteenth Cavalry. Capt. Norvell Is 
1 CONC now stationed at Fort Robinson, Neb. The wedding will take place here In October,  though the day is not set. Gen and Mrs'. Ovenshine and Miss Ovenshine have just returned from Oguncuit, Me., where they spent the Summer.
1 CONT 1907
